{"title":"Maryland mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Maryland_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Maryland middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Maryland_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Maryland high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Maryland_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Maryland middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Maryland_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Maryland middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Maryland_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Maryland MathCounts (page does not exist)\">Maryland MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.integirls.org\">inteGIRLS</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dc.integirls.org\">D.C.</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baltimore.integirls.org\">Baltimore</a>) April/May</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Montgomery_County_Middle_School_Math_League\" title=\"Montgomery County Middle School Math League\">Montgomery County Middle School Math League</a> in school, Nov to Feb</li>\n<li>Montgomery Blair Math Tournament (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mbmt.mbhs.edu/\">MBMT</a>) in Silver Spring, April</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://groups.io/g/CMP-mathclub/topic/mathalon/93230445\">MD Mathalon</a> October (don't need to go through school)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Carderock_Math_Contest\" title=\"Carderock Math Contest\">USNavy Carderock Math Contest</a> in Bethesda, May (don't need to go through school)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Maryland_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Maryland high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Maryland_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Maryland high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Anne_Arundel_High_School_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Anne Arundel High School Math League (page does not exist)\">Anne Arundel High School Math League</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.integirls.org\">inteGIRLS</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dc.integirls.org\">D.C.</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baltimore.integirls.org\">Baltimore</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Johns_Hopkins_University_High_School_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Johns Hopkins University High School Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">Johns Hopkins University High School Math Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.johnshopkinsmathtournament.com/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Montgomery_County_Interscholastic_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Montgomery County Interscholastic Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Montgomery County Interscholastic Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Salisbury_University_Annual_High_School_Mathematics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Salisbury University Annual High School Mathematics Competition (page does not exist)\">Salisbury University Annual High School Mathematics Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Maryland_High_School_Mathematics_Competition\" title=\"University of Maryland High School Mathematics Competition\">University of Maryland High School Mathematics Competition</a></li>\n<li>Howard County Math League</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Maryland_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Maryland_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://groups.io/g/CMP-mathclub\">Chesapeake Math Program memorial email list</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://bbmc-math.com\">Bonnie Branch Math Club</a> organizes independent non-school teams for contests.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018094113\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 25/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1410:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018094113 and revision id 279975. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}